       <p class="c1 c29 c15"><span class="c2">We may aggregate and/or transform any information provided so that it cannot be associated with any issuer and publish, distribute or use such aggregated or transformed information as part of ICRA general business activities or any other materials, to the extent the same is in compliance with the SEBI (Credit Rating Agencies) Regulations, 1999 and relevant guidelines &amp; circulars issued by RBI and SEBI from time to time . It is further clarified that ICRA may utilise the information and/ or such insights as it may have gained at any stage in the course of its activity under this Agreement, in its activity as a monitoring agency or a credit rating agency.</span></p>
