       <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
       <p class="c1 c29 c15"><span class="c2">ICRA will pay the stamp duty in relation to this Agreement (and any SOW entered into pursuant hereto) and prior to execution by ICRA, this Agreement (and any SOW entered into pursuant hereto) will be annexed to a stamp paper of appropriate value procured for this Agreement (or any SOW entered into pursuant hereto).</span></p>
