       <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c2"></span></p>
       <p class="c1 c29 c15"><span class="c2">No consent, amendment, modification, supplement, or waiver of this Agreement or any provision of this Agreement (inclusive of any SOW entered into pursuant hereto) will be effective if provided by means of an electronic click-through or any other electronic means. No one in ICRA will be bound by or subject to any terms or conditions of use (&ldquo;</span><span class="c19 c5 c3">Website Terms</span><span class="c2">&rdquo;)  for access to a website containing information with respect to you or information provided by you or on your behalf even if any such person clicks-through or has clicked-through to such Website Terms by electronic means at any time before or after the date of this Agreement. No amendment or waiver of this Agreement (inclusive of any SOW entered into pursuant hereto) will be effective unless evidenced by handwritten signature of an authorized representative of ICRA.</span></p>
