       <ol class="c13 lst-kix_list_6-0" start="8">
           <li class="c1 c6 li-bullet-0"><span class="c2">Both Parties have to comply with the provisions of Goods and Services Tax laws (hereinafter referred to as &ldquo;GST&rdquo;, which includes but is not limited to the Central Goods and Services Tax Act, 2017 (&lsquo;CGST&rsquo;); Union Territory Goods and Services Tax Act, 2017 (&lsquo;UTGST&rsquo;); Respective State Goods and Services Tax Act 2017 (&lsquo;SGST&rsquo;); and Integrated Goods and Services Tax Act, 2017 (&lsquo;IGST&rsquo;). The Company shall be responsible and liable for the payment of GST as more fully provided in any SOW entered into pursuant hereto. </span></li>
